  "changes": [
    "Keep published login/session/token/TWP1 contract and exact dependency lock.",
    "Add loopback-only configuration readiness and no-credential HTTP startup; protect token/usage with existing authentication then explicit 503.",
    "Use local .env or process configuration without updating dependencies; add real TCP synthetic tests.",
    "Ignore the shared configuration helper temporary credential files (.env.tansr-configure-*.tmp) and its ownership lock (.tansr-configure.lock); .env.example remains distributable.",
